<mxCell id="c144" value="Media API uses JWT + role guards: create/review Shop or system roles; submit COLLABORATOR or SYSTEM_ADMIN; list includes KOL/Shop/system. UploadController has no local UseGuards decorators; it streams bytes and does not create MediaAsset." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="3608" width="4600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c145" value="KOL list requires APPROVED StoreCollaborator in active non-deleted Store, and shows approved assets or own submissions (even pending/rejected/hidden). Campaign participation is checked only when flagged. Shop review is a separate PATCH flow with ownership, reason rules, transaction/audit and landing-cache invalidation." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="3663" width="4600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c146" value="Stored text copy and frontend caption copy are different actions. Coupon list loads separately; templates use product SKU/ID in a hardcoded product URL, not a generated affiliate short link. Clipboard rejection is not caught; success UI can appear before writeText finishes." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="3718" width="4600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c147" value="Upload failure currently sets a local blob URL for video testing; normal submission backend rejects blob: URLs. Modal uploads use shared api directly (default timeout), not uploadService.uploadVideo with its longer timeout. No HD pixel/duration guarantee is checked here." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="3773" width="4600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c148" value="Single download opens source URL; ZIP generation is local, max 250 MB of media bytes, includes TXT scripts and source links for streaming/unfetchable files. Copy does not generate an API audit/count. Soft-delete and sample-request-specific submissions are related flows outside the main sequence." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="25" y="3828" width="4600" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>